# Secrets for Kamal deployment.
#
# The only secret needed is the GHCR registry password:
#   - In CI, GitHub Actions provides GITHUB_TOKEN.
#   - Locally, fall back to `gh auth token` (needs write:packages to push).
#
# SECRET_KEY_BASE is a clear env var in deploy.yml — this is a public read-only
# docs site, so the key is not sensitive enough to warrant a secrets fetch.
KAMAL_REGISTRY_PASSWORD=$(gh auth token 2>/dev/null || echo "$GITHUB_TOKEN")
